108 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (A HashMap stores patient and doctor records so that any record can be found directly by its ID without scanning the whole list. A PriorityQueue maintains the waiting queue so that emergency patients are always called before normal patients, and patients with the same priority are called in the order in which they arrived. An ArrayList stores the booked appointments. Java string operations are used to trim and validate the text entered in the registration form.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
