/E (The Hospital Management System demonstrates how a HashMap, a PriorityQueue, an ArrayList and Java string processing can be combined to register patients, find records quickly and serve urgent patients first. It also shows basic integration between a frontend \(HTML, CSS, JavaScript\) and a Spring Boot backend through REST endpoints. The project is simple and easy to demonstrate, and it can be extended in the future with the features listed under Future Scope.)
